# ideationData: Events/TEMPLATES and Roadmap are tracked; per-event generated
# output (ideation / art-requirement PDFs, feedback stores) is not.
#
# Roadmap/Roadmap.xlsx is the Feishu roadmap export that the Sprint Board tab
# requires. It contains unreleased event names and launch dates, so it is only
# committed because THIS REPO IS PRIVATE. If it is ever made public again, this
# file must be removed from the repo and its history first.
ideationData/**
!ideationData/Events/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/**
!ideationData/Roadmap/
!ideationData/Roadmap/**
